the n0 is lorenz samplerate=quarter rho=0.96
the n1 is stepseq samplerate=half s2=0.753
the n2 is mixer in6=0.642
the n3 is reverblite
the n4 is ringmod
n1.step -35> n0
n0.y -> n0.rho
n4 -> n1.reset
n2 ~> n1.s1
n1.step -> n1.s2
fader3 ~> n1.s6
n4 ~> n1.s7
n1.gate -35> n1.s8
n1 -> n2.in2
play ~> n2.in3
n0.z -> n2.in6
fader4 -> n3
play -> n3.size
n0.y -> n4.pitch
n1 -> right
n2 -> left
n3 -> out
